<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - American General downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - American General downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it downgraded American General Corp to market outperform from the firm's recommended list.</p>
<p>-- The stock fell one to 36-7/8.</p>
